; Several errors at one place, and their ids: the n-th error of a kind at a place has the id (place, kind, n).
; - A budget-transfer in a commodity neither budget converts has two BudgetCommodityMismatch errors at its place: its
;   `from` budget's first (#0), then its `to` budget's (#1), whatever their names.
; - A budget-transfer between two budgets that do not exist reports its `from` budget only.
; - A posting to an account linked to two budgets has each budget's error at the posting, in the order of the
;   budgets' names, whatever the order of the `budget` entries: two that do not exist, two in whose commodity no price
;   converts it, two that are closed.
option "operating_currency" "CNY"
option "timezone" "UTC"

1970-01-01 commodity CNY
1970-01-01 commodity USD

2024-01-01 open Assets:Bank
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Ghosts
  budget: Zulu
  budget: Delta
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Dollars
  budget: Zeta
  budget: Alpha
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Closed
  budget: Yankee
  budget: Bravo

2024-01-01 budget Zeta CNY
2024-01-01 budget Alpha CNY
2024-01-01 budget Yankee CNY
2024-01-01 budget Bravo CNY

2024-01-02 budget-transfer Zeta Alpha 10 USD

2024-01-03 budget-transfer Nope-Zulu Nope-Alpha 1 CNY

2024-01-04 * "Shop" "an account of two budgets that do not exist"
  Expenses:Ghosts 1 CNY
  Assets:Bank

2024-01-05 * "Shop" "an account of two budgets, in dollars no price converts"
  Expenses:Dollars 5 USD
  Assets:Bank

2024-01-06 budget-close Yankee
2024-01-06 budget-close Bravo

2024-01-07 * "Shop" "an account of two closed budgets"
  Expenses:Closed 2 CNY
  Assets:Bank

2024-01-08 budget Alpha USD
